  abilityName: .45 Long Gun
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP, boosts own critical rate), 7 combo Thunder attack on single foe (or probable
    5% damage of foes' max HP), boosts Thunder elemental damage for 3 turns, boosts
    own spark damage for 3 turns & boosts own Atk relative to max HP for 3 turns
